@235 = ~Negation~

@236 = ~This is the armor worn by Frod Lannas when he ruled the Citadel of Exhalus. When an army of vacuous attempted to seize the citadel, the Doomguard and several Dustmen fought valiantly and drove the monsters back. But the losses were heavy, and many disappeared. After the battle, the armor was found floating alone near the citadel. The monsters had been unable to devour it. No one knows what became of Frod, and still less how the armor can remain solid on a Material Plane....

It is made of solidified negative void, which should not even be possible. But on the planes, nothing is impossible.

STATISTICS:

Equipped Abilities:
- Any opponent who strikes the wearer in melee suffers 2D6 magical damage and must make a Save vs. Death at +4 or be disintegrated
- Magic Resistance: +50%

Armor Class: -3 (-7 vs. slashing, -6 vs. piercing and missile weapons)
Requires: Strength 3

Weight: 5~

