@238 = ~Forged by the mad blacksmith Galsconi from a bone of Gaurak the Beast, this weapon resembles a piece of rotten ivory carved into a greatsword. Its hilt is wrapped in blackened, torn leather that seems ready to fall apart at the slightest touch. More disturbing still is the yellow sap that this bone sword seems to secrete as soon as it is picked up.

