@284 = ~This is, to say the least, an unusual item. As far as anyone knows, it was crafted at the end of the First Flowering by Kyanka, a royal mage and enchanter who was no longer entirely sane. He is said to have had a rather peculiar sense of humor, which might explain the morbid pleasure he took in rendering his opponents incapable of thinking clearly before finishing them off. It appears that this robe was worn only very rarely.

